    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d16">

                <pb facs="0121" n="9" sameAs="frus:frus1910/pg9"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 14503/85.</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Minister Sherrill to the Secretary of
                    State.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >American Legation</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Buenos
                                Aires</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1910-06-18"
                                ><hi rendition="#italic">June 18, 1910</hi></date>.</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 428.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor to report, supplementing
                    my No. 387 of the 25th ultimo,<anchor n="1" xml:id="d16-f1"/> that I have to-day
                    received from the minister for foreign affairs an acknowledgment of the
                    congratulations, transmitted through this legation from the President and from
                    yourself upon the occasion of the centenary anniversary of Argentine
                    independence. A copy and translation of the minister’s note are inclosed
                    herewith in duplicate.</p>
                <p>I have, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">C. H. Sherrill.</hi></signed></closer>


                <xi:include href="d16-a1.xml" xpointer="d16-a1"/>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
